[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Pherb API installed.

1. Copy and edit the configuration file:
   cp %%PREFIX%%/www/pherb/config/settings.ini.sample \
      %%PREFIX%%/www/pherb/config/settings.ini

2. Configure your Apache VirtualHost to point to:
   DocumentRoot %%PREFIX%%/www/pherb/api

3. Ensure MariaDB credentials are set in settings.ini.

See: https://docs.pacyworld.com/books/ai-speech-processing/chapter/pherb-orchestrator
EOM
}
]
